{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "竖直线与斜率：为什么 x=2 没有斜率",
    "goals": [
      "区分水平线与竖直线在斜率定义下的本质差异",
      "理解直线 x=2 斜率不存在（未定义）的代数与几何原因"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "认真肯定学生的质疑，坦诚纠正错误并说明山路比喻的适用边界",
        "通过爬山坡比喻对比水平地面（上升为0）与垂直峭壁（横向位移为0导致除以0）"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -4,
        "max": 4,
        "label": "直线斜率 k",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.04
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "请把直线斜率 k调到 -4。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "拖动左下角的滑杆，观察数值和画面同步变化。"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "完成，直线斜率 k已经调到 -4。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": -4,
          "tolerance": 0.02
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "reflections": [
      {
        "as": "section-02-reflection-02",
        "prompt": "如果有一条直线方程是 x = -5，它的斜率是多少？为什么？",
        "answer": "斜率同样不存在。因为 x = -5 是一条竖直线，线上任意两点的横坐标之差 Δx = 0，在斜率公式中会出现分母为 0 的情况，因此没有定义。",
        "anchor": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "纠正误区：区分斜率为0的水平线与斜率不存在的竖直线",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "你说得太对了，必须先谢谢你帮我抓到这个漏洞！水平的直线斜率才是 0，竖直的直线根本不是 0。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "竖直线与斜率：为什么 x=2 没有斜率",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "直线的倾斜与山路",
                "items": [
                  "斜率 = 纵向变化量 ÷ 横向变化量",
                  "水平地面：高度变化为 0，斜率是 0",
                  "竖直峭壁：横向无法前进，没有斜率"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "我们把直线看成一段山路：斜率就是向右每走一段距离，高度往上升了多少。屏幕上现在是一条水平线 y=0，我们向右走，高度完全没变，所以 0 除以任何横向距离都是 0，水平线的斜率确实是 0。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "旋转直线观察倾斜程度",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -1,
                    "max": 1,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(x)",
                    "label": "y = kx"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 0,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(0)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "(number_01)*(1)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "山路如果越来越陡，斜率数值就越来越大。看，当坡度变大时，向右走一步，上升的高度就猛增。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 3,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "但如果这条路彻底竖直起来，变成一堵悬崖呢？这时候你根本无法向右走，横向变化量变成了 0！数学里分母不能为 0，所以竖直直线不是斜率很大，而是根本没有斜率。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "强调横向变化量为零时分母无意义",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "代数推导与总结：从两点坐标看 x=2 为什么产生除以零",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "你敏锐地抓到了最关键的矛盾：直线 x=2 上根本走不出向右的步子！我们挑出这条线上的两个点，比如 (2, 0) 和 (2, 3)。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "套进斜率公式算一算：纵坐标的变化量是 3 减 0 等于 3，但横坐标的变化量是 2 减 2 等于 0。分母变成了 0！",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "k = \\frac{y_2 - y_1}{x_2 - x_1} = \\frac{3 - 0}{2 - 2} = \\frac{3}{0} \\quad (\\text{无意义})"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "推导直线两点代入斜率公式时分母为零",
              "when": "before_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "在数学里除数不能为零，所以 3 除以 0 没有意义。直线 x=2 的斜率不是 0，而是不存在！",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "重要结论",
                "items": [
                  "水平线：Δy = 0，斜率 = 0",
                  "竖直线：Δx = 0，分母为 0，斜率不存在"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "我们再把这条可调节的斜线调回到平缓的水平状态，亲自看一看斜率真正为 0 的模样吧！",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 0,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "水平线向右走高度不改变，斜率是 0；竖直线如 x=2 横向变化量为 0，分母为 0 无意义，因此竖直线没有斜率。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
